<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Q4 industry orders unchanged yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Q4 industry orders unchanged yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders received by Swiss industry in the fourth quarter rose 3.2 percent from the third quarter, but were unchanged compared with a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				     Q4	  Q3	  Q4, 1995</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		zero	-1.0	-5.0</p>
<p> Index (1975 average=100)    98.4	95.3	99.0</p>
<p>Domestic orders</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		zero	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>Foreign orders</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		+3.0	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>Orders on hand</p>
<p> Pct change yr/yr		-5.0	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p> Index (1975 average =100)   87.8	88.2	92.0</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
